+### User transfer
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` moves a user (for example between group
+companies) to the organization named in `toOrgId`.
+
+- Only an org admin of `orgID` may transfer users. Callers from another organization → 404;
+  callers in `orgID` who are not org admins → 403.
+- The user must belong to `orgID`, otherwise → 404.
+- `toOrgId` must be non-empty, different from `orgID`, and an existing organization
+  (one that has at least one user or project); otherwise → 400.
+- The user's org admin flag is cleared, since admin rights apply to one organization only.
+- Project memberships are kept. They stop granting access while the user is outside the
+  project's organization, and grant access again if the user moves back.
+
